====================================================================================================
    source / rho~ = -4*w2 - 2   (to O(eps^2))
  [PASS] 1a the scalar's source is -2 rho~ (1 + 2 w^2) + O(eps^4): no phi-linear term (TeVeS's e^{-2phi}-free source), a w^2 factor from the aether's motion
